{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05237","headline":"赠皇甫侍御赴都八首 七 · 元希声","name":"赠皇甫侍御赴都八首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"会合非我，关山坐违。\n离鸿晓引，别叶秋飞。\n騑骖徐动，尊饯相依。\n远情超忽，岐路光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元希声","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}